  "releaseNotes": "NEW\n\t\t\t* SourceProject.IsSpecProject: whether a project reaches TSpec, whatever its name\n\t\t\t* SourceProject.OpensInternalsTo: the projects its InternalsVisibleTo names, read without Roslyn\n\t\t\t* DependencyGraph: Acyclic(), a failure naming the first loop\n\t\t\t* Source.Projects: NonRedundant()\n\t\t\t* TSpec.Extensibility: Build.TryFindPackage, the package of the build an assembly comes from\n\t\t\tCHANGED\n\t\t\t* A snake_case test name reads as written: every underscore a space, each word as it is spelled\n\t\t\tOBSOLETE\n\t\t\t* Redundant(): NonRedundant() takes the place of not.Redundant()",
